Portions of staramp derived from cliamp:

  - The visualizer analysis pipeline (src/vis/analysis.rs) and the peak
    ballistics (src/vis/ballistics.rs), ported from cliamp's
    ui/visualizer.go and ui/vis_classic_peak.go.
